        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Measure time in weeks",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "周 measures weeks. Both 一周 and 一个周 are possible. Learn the specific time expression rather than applying a blanket classifier rule.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我等了一周。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ děng le yī zhōu 。",
                "meaning": "I waited for one week.",
                "audio": "800dd04317bd8e3ab10bdc95fe020ef102825b700bdee6a5dbaaad413a35992e"
              },
              {
                "text": "他两周以后来。",
                "pinyin": "tā liǎng zhōu yǐhòu lái 。",
                "meaning": "He will come in two weeks.",
                "audio": "9a8b72b1fe3dfff397c0f818e5632aa8546f970b77e9e4438eab46738062dc81"
              }
            ]
